{"id":151,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"愛・知・和と探究発表で個性を伸ばす","feature_description":"大宮開成中高一貫部は校訓「愛・知・和」を教育の柱とし、他者を尊重する心、知識と知性に基づく判断、多様性を大切にする姿勢を育てます。授業と探究、プレゼンテーション教育、愛知和ラーニング、英会話などを通じて、国際的な視野と社会課題に向き合う力を養います。進路面談や学校行事、部活動を通して自立・自律も促す方針です。探究と発表を通じて学びを深めることも大切にしています。","clubs":[{"id":2785,"name":"アーチェリー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2788,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2789,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2791,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2792,"name":"チアダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2795,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2796,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2798,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2804,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2806,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2812,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2815,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.omiyakaisei.jp/jshs/campus_life/faq/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2816,"name":"クイズ研究部","category":"文化部","sou